id=phonesystemui
name=Phone SystemUI (status bar + shade)
version=v5
versionCode=5
author=karl0ss
description=abxylute One: forces the phone SystemUI (status bar, notification shade, quick settings) instead of the TV one, and binds SystemUI as keyguard. Undo without root: adb shell cmd overlay disable uk.karl.phonesystemui.overlay && adb shell cmd overlay disable uk.karl.phonesystemui.frameworkoverlay, then reboot.
